 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Settings.LegitRange">Delay after map change (ms) — min / max</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Settings.AntiStuckTitle">Anti-stuck</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Settings.AntiStuckHint">Detects a script that is running but no longer progressing (looping without acting, stuck in a dialog, blocked after a map change) and attempts a gentle unblock. Combat, gathering, movement and death are never affected. No automatic reconnection.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Settings.AntiStuckEnabled">Watch for stalls (gentle unblock: close a dialog)</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Settings.AntiStuckRestart">Restart the script if still stuck (more intrusive)</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Settings.AntiStuckReconnect">Reconnect the bot if it stays stuck (max 3 per hour, never in combat)</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.AntiStuck.Reconnecting">{0} stuck: automatic account reconnection.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Settings.AntiStuckTimeout">Stall timeout (s)</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Settings.AntiAfkTitle">Anti-inactivity</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Settings.AntiAfkHint">If neither the client nor the bot sent an action to the server for this long (plus a small random delay), the character changes facing. Only outside combat, exchange, dialog and movement. Stops the inactivity disconnect.</sys:String>
