 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Planning.LogStop">Schedule: {0} left the range → auto-stopping the script (by schedule, not a manual stop).</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Planning.LogSwitch">Schedule: {0} moves to the next range → stopping the current script, starting the script "{1}".</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Planning.LogSwitchFallback">Schedule: {0} moves to the next range → stopping the current script, starting the fallback script (no script assigned to the range).</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Planning.LogKeep">Schedule: {0} moves to the next range — same script, it keeps running.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Planning.LogStopNoScript">Schedule: {0} moves to the next range → stopping the current script (nothing to run for this range).</sys:String>
