 <sys:String x:Key="L.Reconnect.Tip">Reconnects this account right away, on the same character, without removing it from the bot list; the running script resumes once back in game. MITM: Dofus is relaunched. Socket: the session is reconnected. Active game session: asks for confirmation.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Reconnect.ConfirmTitle">Reconnect this account?</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Reconnect.ConfirmBody">The game session will be cut (a fight in progress is lost). MITM: Dofus is relaunched right away, straight into the game on the same character. Socket: the session is reconnected immediately. The bot stays in the list and the running script resumes once back in game.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Reconnect.Busy">A reconnection is already in progress for this account.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Reconnect.NoLicense">Cannot reconnect: license not authorized.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Reconnect.NoMapping">protocol not loaded yet — cannot reconnect for now.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Mapping.MissingFieldsFmt">Server mapping incomplete for this version: {0} required field(s) missing. Some bot actions may not work (details in the console).</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Reconnect.Status">Reconnecting…</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Reconnect.StatusStep">Reconnecting — {0}</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Reconnect.LogNow">Reconnection requested: client relaunched immediately (the bot stays in the list).</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Reconnect.LogNowScript">Reconnection requested: client relaunched immediately — script “{0}” will resume once back in game.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Reconnect.ToastNow">{0}: reconnecting…</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Reconnect.Done">Reconnected: back in game.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Reconnect.OtherChar">Reconnected on another character ({0}): script not resumed.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Reconnect.SocketLog">Reconnection requested: wait cancelled, reconnecting immediately.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Reconnect.SocketCutLog">Reconnection requested: session cut, reconnecting immediately (the bot stays in the list).</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Reconnect.SocketNow">Socket: reconnecting…</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Reconnect.SocketGhost">Socket: previous session still held by the server — retrying in {0} s…</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Reconnect.RoadLost">Route recording interrupted by the client relaunch: stop it and start it again.</sys:String>
