 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.BuyBudget">Buying budget (kamas, 0 = buying disabled)</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.BuyHint">Empty list. Search for an item: “Add” for a free list (custom recipe), “Recipe” to load its ingredients.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.BuyList">Buy list</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.PriceProgress">Prices {0}/{1}</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.PriceSummary">Prices: {0} row(s) with prices, {1} without.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.PlanSummary">{0} row(s) · {1} still to buy · estimated cost {2} / remaining budget {3} kamas</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.RecipeName">Name of the item to craft</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.RecipeMultiplier">Number of crafts</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.LoadRecipe">Load the recipe ingredients</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.MaxLotPrice">Price cap for this lot (0 = not set)</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.BuyLotSize">Purchased lot size</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.BuySearchWatermark">Search for an in-game item and click the result to add it.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.BuySteps">1. Add items (search) or load a recipe. 2. Enter the wanted quantity: what the character already owns is deducted. 3. “Fetch prices” shows the cost without buying anything. 4. “Buy the list” buys what is missing lot by lot, without exceeding your maximum prices.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.BuyTheList">Buy the list</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.BuyThresholdsExplain">A lot is only bought if at least this quantity is missing. By default the lot size (never any surplus); lower, a surplus is accepted.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.Clear">Clear</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.DecomposeAll">Decompose all</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.DecomposeIngredients">Decompose the ingredients</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.DeductStock">Deduct what the character already owns (bag + bank)</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.DelayBetweenBuys">Delay between two purchases (ms)</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.DiscordNotif">Discord notifications</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.DiscordNotifExplain">A Discord webhook receives a message for the ticked categories: sales, purchases, listings and price updates, pods full, not enough kamas.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.FetchPrices">Fetch prices (quotes)</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.IgnorePrice">Buy regardless of price</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.Item">Item</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.ItemType">Item type</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.Job">Job</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.Level">Level</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.LinkRelist">Link with relisting</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.LotBiggestFirst">Biggest first</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.LotSmallestFirst">Smallest first</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.LotStrategy">Automatically chosen lot size</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.Lots1000IfMissing">Lots of 1,000 if at least that many are missing</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.Lots100IfMissing">Lots of 100 if at least that many are missing</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.Lots10IfMissing">Lots of 10 if at least that many are missing</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.Lots1IfMissing">Lots of 1 if at least that many are missing</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.MassMaxPrice">Bulk maximum price</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.MaxFromCurrent">Current max prices ± %</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.MaxFromMarket">Max price = server average price + %</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.MaxFromSeen">Max price = observed prices + %</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.MinGainKamas">Minimum gain (kamas)</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.MinGainPct">Minimum gain (%)</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.NewListingPrice">Price of new listings</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.NoCompetitor">Price when nobody sells this lot size</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.NoCompetitorFromNeighbor">From the neighbouring size (capped at the average price)</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.NoCompetitorKeep">Keep the current price</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.NotifyBuys">Purchases</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.NotifyNoKamas">Not enough kamas</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.NotifyPodsFull">Pods full</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.NotifyReprice">Listings and price updates</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.NotifySales">Sales</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.PriceProbe">Pause between two price requests (ms)</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.PriceTtl">Market price validity (s)</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.Quantity">Quantity</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.RelistExplain">During automatic repricing, each sold lot is immediately replaced by a lot of the same size taken from the bag or bank, at the market price.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.RelistOnSale">Relist as soon as a tracked lot is sold</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.RelistTheseAgain">Relist these items</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.RelistWake">Relisting after a sale (ms)</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.RepriceEnabled">Update the prices of my lots</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.RetryAfterRefusal">New attempt after a refusal (s)</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.RetryUntilSuccess">Retry the purchase every N s until it succeeds (0 = no)</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.ScanHint">Crafts: cost of the ingredients versus the result, based on the real price seen at the Auction House during the session, otherwise the server average price, sale tax deducted. Resale: buy one lot size and resell in another, based on the prices observed during the session. These are estimates: the average price is neither the cheapest lot nor a guaranteed sale.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.ScanItemWatermark">Search for an item…</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.ScanModeCraft">Profitable crafts</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.ScanModeResell">Resale (lot size change)</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.ScanTitle">Profitability scanner</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.LocalScanHint">Read-only: scans at most 12 tracked items (Buy, Relist, sales, selection) or items found via search. Quotes only use the minimum prices PER LOT seen during the session on the connected server (valid for 10 to 120 s). Craft: ingredients from the local database. Resale: grouping small lots into bigger ones. Estimated margin after tax, no sale guaranteed; no purchase or listing performed.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.LocalScanOpen">Open the Auction House in game on a connected and authorised character to collect prices.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.LocalScanRunning">Collecting prices per lot (read-only)…</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.LocalScanNoDb">Recipes unavailable: local database dofus.sqlite not found.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.LocalScanJobCraftOnly">The Job filter only applies to the Craft scan; select “All jobs” for resale.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.LocalScanEmpty">No tracked item or no recipe matching the filters. Add items to Buy / Relist or enter an in-game item.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.LocalScanAllTypes">All types</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.LocalScanAllJobs">All jobs</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.LocalScanDone">{0} result(s), {1} item(s) probed, {2} without a recent quote. Indicative quotes, no transaction.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.LocalScanLimit">Search limited to the first 12 tracked items.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.LocalScanCancelled">Scan interrupted: session or character changed.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.LocalScanError">Scan interrupted: {0}</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.LocalScanSortCost">Sort by cost</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.LocalScanCost">Estimated cost</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.LocalScanNetValue">Estimated net value</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.LocalScanVerify">Check again</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.ScopeAll">Update all lots</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.ScopeCheapest">The N cheapest lots</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.ScopeMostExpensive">The N most expensive lots</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.Sell">Sell</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.SellCycleEvery">Selling cycle every N runs (0 = never)</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.Server">Server</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.SettingsHint">Settings for this character. Saved and applied immediately. The Auction House and Buy views only keep what is needed while the bot is running.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.Sniper">Sniper (lots far below the average price)</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Hdv.SniperExplain">The bot loops through the list and buys any allowed lot sold at no more than this percentage of the server average price (and below its maximum price if it has one). The wanted quantity acts as a cap (0 = no limit); the budget limits the spend.</sys:String>
