 <sys:String x:Key="L.Lua.Editor.Shortcuts">Ctrl+Space: completion · Ctrl+Shift+Space: signature · Ctrl+F / Ctrl+H: find / replace · Ctrl+G: go to line · Ctrl+/: comment · Shift+Alt+F: format · F8: next problem · F5: run / restart · Shift+F5: stop · Ctrl+S: save</sys:String>
