 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Combat.StyleHint">Aggressive: moves into range then casts by priority. Runner: casts then moves away from enemies. Passive: casts only if already in range. “self” = spell cast on my own cell (buff/heal).</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Combat.FinishKill">Finish off targets killable this turn first</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Combat.FinishKillTip">On top of the targeting mode: if an enemy can be killed with the damage the rotation can land this turn (absolute HP), it becomes the first target to deny it a turn. Conservative estimate (average damage, current AP).</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Combat.TurboAckAll">Acknowledge every fighter's actions</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Combat.TurboAckAllTip">Turbo: besides your own sequences, also acknowledges those of monsters and allies as soon as they end, without waiting for the animation. Setting stored in the profile.</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Combat.TurboEagerReady">Aggressive turn pass</sys:String>
 <sys:String x:Key="L.Bots.Combat.TurboEagerReadyTip">Turbo: answers "turn ready" as soon as a turn ends (and from the first acknowledgement of the fight) instead of waiting for the server's request. Setting stored in the profile.</sys:String>
