 <sys:String x:Key="L.Exp.ContinueAfterDeathTip">After a defeat the character comes straight back and the expedition (or dungeon) keeps going. Unchecked: stop at the first defeat.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="L.Exp.Fight">Fight on the maps visited</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="L.Exp.FightTip">Attacks groups matching the monster filters on every map of the zone. Unchecked: the zone is only used for travel or harvesting.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="L.Exp.Gather">Harvest on the maps visited</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="L.Exp.GatherTip">Harvests the resources your jobs can collect on every map, before fighting. Full pods: bank if enabled.</sys:String>

